msgid "⟪k:0⟫Come to me, and yer sweetheart’s day’ll be sure as made!"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫V’nez m’voir et vot’fiancée s’ra ben contente !"

#: scenario:scenario_D5F2CCF4_3D86_4D93_848D_3932CB107D19
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
