#: scenario:scenario_3B0F7449_39EB_4240_9E25_DBB6E94A0C14
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 0bbac9565bbecb3621199adaee1ba0e8eb9cac7de012f9255b370a299fd18111
