msgctxt "scenario:scenario_3B0F7449_39EB_4240_9E25_DBB6E94A0C14"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫Patient as my father may be, ⟪k:1⟫that⟪k:2⟫ would certainly anger him.⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫I can hear "
"it now... ⟪k:5⟫“You’re wasting your God-given talents, boy!”"
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Mon père a beau être patient, ⟪k:1⟫ça⟪k:2⟫, ça le mettrait certainement en colère.⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫"
"Je l’entends d’ici... ⟪k:5⟫« Tu gâches le talent que Dieu t’a donné, mon⟪k:6⟫ garçon ! »"

#: scenario:scenario_402D80F1_46E8_4470_B8D6_408B949EF7C4
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
