#: scenario:scenario_8F2BF860_50C4_4AEF_8EC8_B9505BA171E5
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 6181a213e806af18d343f8cf38e0a6f0b73645edb8e760097cc144aade623a85
#. default-sha256: e5c3735114510700b85a54d2ea559e66986a2ee0e511d684ff6eb79ccdf5f472
msgctxt "scenario:scenario_8F2BF860_50C4_4AEF_8EC8_B9505BA171E5"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫As he drew closer to the mansion, the rich fragrance of roses grew more prominent. ⟪k:1⟫Over "
"time, this distinctive scent had led visitors to refer to the house as “Rose Manor.”"
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Au fur et à mesure qu’il se rapprochait du manoir, le parfum enivrant des roses devenait de "
"plus en plus prégnant. ⟪k:1⟫Au fil du temps, cette odeur bien particulière avait poussé les "
"visiteurs à nommer la demeure « Manoir des Roses »."

#: scenario:scenario_30E272F1_7AE7_4E5E_B4D4_730C419387AC
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 420b0b07ef63d9d0ae09309b94d06bf20e3dd20257c2df386cc56e42fc1c333f
#. default-sha256: bde376467ce1d064ab59989ba247ce16dac18c84b105f2d6dbddda1701326868
msgctxt "scenario:scenario_30E272F1_7AE7_4E5E_B4D4_730C419387AC"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫It was also probably a play on the flaxen-haired family’s last name, “Rhodes,” which you "
"heard the owner of the jewelry store say just moments earlier."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫C’était aussi probablement un jeu de mots sur leur nom de famille, « Rhodes » - vous venez "
"d’entendre le propriétaire de la bijouterie le mentionner."

#: scenario:scenario_F5502D53_9AB9_4E94_BF88_788382F62A14
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 9b31951920a6767c1321f231d13f396e27346be625156843483692c4f00aeaea
#. default-sha256: 67f861bfd4b962868e7ae2447bba420b6398ac58f7b65d1b2505cbf63e0445a5
msgctxt "scenario:scenario_F5502D53_9AB9_4E94_BF88_788382F62A14"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫The mansion looked quite different than it does now, no?⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫No thickets of ivy "
"covering the walls, and no rotten, broken doors to be found."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Le manoir semblait vraiment différent d’aujourd’hui, non ?⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Ni lierre recouvrant les "
"murs, ni porte brisée et rongée par la rouille."

#: scenario:scenario_CEEC7699_92E6_486D_B1EA_7486BE60CB97
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: d25f5e46220cbd6883f6861c3a4d607b08e662ad7fd1624bb95aea344cbc6911
#. default-sha256: 7d9d49032f7f9b43776bc4424ded0c76071cf0c0e446e392c5307f67e37d55d4
msgctxt "scenario:scenario_CEEC7699_92E6_486D_B1EA_7486BE60CB97"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫I wonder what the Rhodes family would think if they saw the house in its present, tragic "
"condition."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Je me demande ce que les Rhodes penseraient s’ils voyaient l’état actuel, tragique, de la "
"maison."

#: scenario:scenario_66746C73_6527_48ED_9DB9_BA3C2A8CCF36
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 607b7851d667ad621b559f4c9591ff172f5b519c7dd7bb940f3fbb4fdb47cb14
#. default-sha256: 4976159d544eebb37c12c55c085bb0e6d09e152edc38665347ff381f70dd9bbb
msgctxt "scenario:scenario_66746C73_6527_48ED_9DB9_BA3C2A8CCF36"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫The sight of their abundantly blooming roses—⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫a veritable symbol of prosperity—⟪k:3⟫"
"⟪k:4⟫long since withered and turned into soil."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Leurs nombreuses roses en fleurs —⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫un vrai symbole de prospérité—⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫ont "
"depuis longtemps fané et sont retournées à la terre."

#: scenario:scenario_59C35A13_5718_45F5_A799_DCB0C19302C5
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: e11810159cc3676c58f6e02dda1622ae5cb91b5fcca57ee1b3b1d7f8fa3e1097
