#: scenario:scenario_9C06200F_FA02_4610_AD3C_72E1EDC8970C
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 10173823fc9a34b239d1ab1a2e30d1d78de2ecba139e5e3de63eb9b1e0b18ec2
